      "description": "A cell-art motif card whose selected state has a border and check.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-motif\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg class=\"ds-motif-preview\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M30 6h4v32h8v4h-8v16h-4V42h-8v-4h8z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-motif-name\">Thanh kiếm</span><svg class=\"ds-motif-check\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-motif{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-height:98px;padding:10px 6px 9px;border:1px solid #cd732d;border-radius:8px;background:#fff4e9;color:#9f4e15;cursor:pointer;transition:background .16s,color .16s}.ds-motif:hover{background:#edf3f6}.ds-motif:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#b95316);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-motif-preview{width:62px;height:58px}.ds-motif-name{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink,#172d40)}.ds-motif-check{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-motif{min-height:88px;padding:9px 3px}.ds-motif-preview{width:48px;height:48px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wall Budget",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "budget",
      "description": "A readable material count, usage bar and remaining-wall sentence.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-budget\" aria-label=\"Ngân sách tường\"><div class=\"ds-budget-heading\"><span>Tường sử dụng</span><strong class=\"ds-budget-count\">168<span class=\"ds-budget-total\"> / 325</span></strong></div><div class=\"ds-budget-track\"><div class=\"ds-budget-fill\" style=\"width:51.7%\"></div></div><p class=\"ds-budget-status\">Còn 157 viên để sáng tạo thêm</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-budget{font-family:\"Be Vietnam Pro\",sans-serif;padding:22px;background:#f8fafb;color:var(--ink,#172d40)}.ds-budget-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11px}.ds-budget-count{font-size:19px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-budget-total{font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted,#536574)}.ds-budget-track{height:6px;border-radius:8px;background:#e0e7e3;margin-top:12px;overflow:hidden}.ds-budget-fill{height:100%;border-radius:8px;background:#5e8567}.ds-budget-status{margin:10px 0 0;color:#496c50;font-size:10px;line-height:1.6}.ds-budget.ds-over .ds-budget-fill{background:#bf491d}.ds-budget.ds-over .ds-budget-status{color:#a1401c}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-budget{padding:18px}.ds-budget-heading{font-size:12px}.ds-budget-status{font-size:12px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Brick-Building Instruction Desk",
    "overview": "Wallcraft pairs paper-white controls and pale blue workspace with navy ink, orange selections and a green village grid. Its character is practical, calm and playful: the layout reads as a construction booklet, while actual game sprites make the result recognizable.\n\nDense settings stay subordinate to the work surface. Counts, dimensions and named states make each change legible; the plan and village views represent the same discrete wall cells.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Countable cells and visible material budgets.",
      "White control surfaces around a dominant green canvas.",
      "Compact Vietnamese typography and clear selected states.",
      "A persistent mobile preview with refinements disclosed on demand."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Countable Mark",
        "body": "Every wall shown represents one actual grid cell; previews and exports must preserve the same coordinates.",
        "section": "overview"
      },
      {
        "name": "Functional Orange",
        "body": "Use orange for active tools, selected motifs, focus and the brand dot; keep the export action navy.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Complete Village",
        "body": "Keep the full grid and tall building sprites inside the canvas, including headroom above the far corner.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve visible counts, dimensions and readiness beside the design.",
      "Do keep plan and village views synchronized with the same cells.",
      "Do retain the sticky mobile preview, collapsed refinements and coordinate controls.",
      "Do pair color states with labels, icons or pressed-state semantics.",
      "Do use the self-hosted Vietnamese font and respect reduced motion."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't crop tall buildings or silently omit walls to fit a preview.",
      "Don't use orange as the default fill for every action.",
      "Don't make precise cell editing depend only on dragging.",
      "Don't hide invalid or empty states behind an enabled export action."
    ]
  }
}
